      "bodyPart": null,
      "description": "The wrought-iron gates of Fetish Dominion loom before you like jagged teeth in the dim twilight. Arcane runes pulse faintly along the bars, humming with dark energy. You've heard whispers of this place—a school for the elite in domination, now experimenting with its first male slave. That's you, TJ. Heart pounding, you push the gates open, stepping onto a gravel path lined with twisted thorns and blooming nightshade. The air thickens with humidity, carrying faint scents of sweat and leather from deeper within. Shadows dance across painterly stone walls, high-contrast lights casting elongated figures that seem to mock your approach. A grand main hall rises ahead, its doors ajar, spilling warm, ominous glow. No turning back now—your new life as the lowest bitch begins here. Sandy, the Head Mistress, awaits inside, ready to break you in. Will you stride confidently or hesitate like the toy you are?",
