      "bodyPart": null,
      "description": "You cross the threshold into the main hall, a cavernous space with chains dangling from vaulted ceilings like industrial vines. Sandy's throne dominates the center—a twisted metal seat etched with submission symbols. She lounges there, legs crossed, her painterly form glowing in high-contrast light. Dark hair cascades over shoulders, eyes piercing like daggers. \"Well, well, the fresh meat arrives. TJ, right? My first male toy in this den of delights.\" Her voice drips authority, a filthy glee underscoring each word. She uncrosses her legs, boot tapping impatiently. \"Kneel before me, bitch. This is Fetish Dominion—your new hell. I'm Sandy, Head Mistress, and you? You're nothing but a slave-student, lowest rank. The Queens will break you, mold you, use you. Obey, and maybe you'll survive. Defy... and suffer deliciously.\" She leans forward, smirking wider. \"First rule: My word is law. Second: Worship without question. Third: No release without permission. Got it? Now, prove you're worth my time.\"",
