      "description": "You drop to your knees, gravel biting into skin through thin fabric. Sandy chuckles, a low, throaty sound that echoes off the walls. \"Good boy. Already learning your place.\" She extends a boot, the leather scuffed yet gleaming in the shadowy light. \"Lick it clean—your first test. Here, we train in submission's arts. You'll face the Queens: Araph with her tickling torments, Nancy demanding foot worship, Aish forcing sweat licks, Gaya edging you to madness, Melissa punishing any release. Stats matter—build obedience to please me, endurance to survive, but arousal and sensitivity? They'll climb, breaking you sweetly.\" As you hesitate or obey, distant footsteps approach. A blue-haired figure—Araph—peeks in, smirking. \"New toy? Can't wait to make him squeal.\" Nancy follows, tall and athletic, barefoot. \"Save some for my soles.\" Sandy waves them off. \"Not yet. TJ, your dorm awaits after this. Fail, and punishment room first.\" The air thickens, your pulse races.",
