      "description": "Sandy's eyes narrow, her smirk twisting into a snarl. \"Refuse? Oh, you stupid fuck. This isn't a negotiation.\" She rises from the throne, towering over you in the high-contrast shadows. Chains rattle faintly above, as if excited for what's next. \"Rules are simple: Obey or break. You're here to serve, TJ—lick, worship, endure. The Queens will test you: Araph's fingers dancing on your ribs till you beg, Nancy's feet grinding your face, Aish smothering you in sweat. Gaya edges without mercy, Melissa slaps post-release. Stats track your pathetic progress—obedience for favor, endurance against torment, arousal building denial, sensitivity amplifying every touch.\" Footsteps echo—Araph saunters in, laughing. \"Defiant already? Fun.\" Nancy trails, unimpressed. \"Break him quick.\" Sandy grabs your collar. \"Lick my boot now, or taste the punishment room. Dorm assignment after—if you earn it.\" Tension coils, your defiance cracking under her gaze.",
